        },
        {
          "id": "line-104",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "When using the URL encoding type, non-ASCII characters that are used in an object's key name will be percent-encoded according to UTF-8 code values. For example, the object test_file(3).png will appear as test_file%283%29.png.\n",
